# BioTron repository push policy

- Never push `Biotron-Site` commits, branches, or tags to `origin` during this work.
- Local commits in `Biotron-Site` are expected for reviewable progress.
- `BioTronStyle` is the shared component package and may be pushed to its `origin` when a shared change must be published for consumers.
- Permission to push `BioTronStyle` is not a requirement; do not push it when the requested integration can use its existing published contents.
- Do not push any other repository unless the user explicitly expands this policy.
